Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:20:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] feat(composer): put the mode with the other behavior
 icons, without its word

The composer's mode was a word ("Execute", "Deep research") beside the model at
the right of the toolbar. It is now an icon with attach, reference, confirmation
policy and reasoning on the left; its name is the tooltip and the accessible
label, and a mode other than Execute keeps the accent colour. The right side is
the model and Send. Its menu opens from the left. The composer spec says the
same.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BHQAws7LSR8fWEJvjbJM4q
